  "rangeUsableEnergy": "Usable energy",
  "rangeUsableHint": "The energy left is the remaining Ah the BMS reports times the mean voltage they will come out at down to cutoff, read off the typical curve for the pack's chemistry. Not times the voltage of this moment, which rises on the charger and drops when you accelerate. Then what the lowest cell strands is taken off. With the chemistry unknown, a figure on the low side is used. The curves are typical for each chemistry, not measured on this pack.",
