  "proximityTitle": "Connect when I get close",
  "proximityBody": "While this is on, the app looks for your BMS every half minute and connects on its own the moment it appears. Meant to be left on for a stretch while a new battery is being calibrated, not forever: while it is connected your BMS's official app cannot get in, and scanning costs some phone battery.",
