  "capacityTitle": "Capacity test",
  "capacityIntro": "The one real measurement in this app. It counts the amp-hours that come out from the highest cell at the top, with the charger already letting go, to the lowest cell at the cutoff or the BMS cutting. The cells mark both ends, not the BMS percentage: that percentage is worked out against the configured capacity, and measuring with it would only hand that setting back.",
