  "verdictConfigChargesWhenFrozenBody": "The cold cutoff is at {value} °C. Charging lithium below zero plates metal inside the cell: it is permanent, it shows up on no figure the BMS reports, and it is the most common way a winter rider ruins a pack. Raise it to 2 °C or more in the official app.",
