  "verdictConfigBalancerOffTitle": "The balancer is switched off",
  "verdictConfigBalancerOffBody": "Without balancing the cells drift apart on their own, and the weakest one decides the end of every charge and every discharge. It is the first cause of packs that lose range with no cell actually being bad.",
